  "sourceReview": [
    "Mutex spin heuristics do not inspect the owner goroutine; normal wakeup differs from starvation handoff. 1 ms is not a wait SLA. Checked internal mutex files 1.25.0/1.26.1 are identical.",
    "WaitGroup 1.17 alignment layout versus 1.25/1.26 atomic state with synctest flag; Go callback contract and changed 1.26.1 non-nil panic handling.",
    "Once publishes after initialization; panic consumes Do without retry. Cancellation is not joining.",
    "Request.Context canceled when ServeHTTP returns, potentially earlier; WriteHeader alone does not cancel it.",
    "errgroup v0.20.0 cancels the derived context on error or Wait return; short declaration in same function body reuses ctx parameter.",
    "Rows.Next exhaustion of final result set closes automatically; break does not. Pool waiting observes cancellation. errors.Join keeps primary and close errors.",
    "TryLock API 1.18; errors.Join 1.20; WithoutCancel 1.21."
  ],
